r is kept in authored/evidence-status.json.","citation_ids":["cite.long.thm-tr-witness-exclusion"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.thm-tr-witness-exclusion"],"id":"long.thm-tr-witness-exclusion","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 8.6 (Witness exclusion)","locator":"Long record Theorem 8.6, p. 95, label thm:tr-witness-exclusion","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*Define the misalignment mass\n$$\n\\mu_J(M):=\\sum_{q=2}^{J}\\frac{2^{M\\bmod q}}{2^q-1}.\n$$\nLet $J\\ge3$, $n\\ge4$, and suppose some $M\\in[n,2n-2]$ has $\\mu_J(M)\\le\\tfrac{11}{15}$. Then no Boolean prefix $D\\subseteq\\{2,\\ldots,n-1\\}$ satisfies\n$$\nT_{n+1}^{(J)}<\\tfrac12-\\sum_{d\\in D}w_d^{(J)}<w_n^{(J)};\n$$\nThis excludes the specified gap for every Boolean prefix, not only the greedy prefix.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/long.thm-tr-witness-exclusion","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/long.thm-tr-witness-exclusion","id":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/edges/%5B%22long.thm-tr-witness-exclusion%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_witness_exclusion%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/edges/%5B%22long.thm-tr-witness-exclusion%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_witness_exclusion%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_witness_exclusion"},{"derived":true,"family":"provenance","from":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/long.thm-tr-witness-exclusion","id":"field:12db1cdd15b744fcc3ea6b2d2974b32807a6655c5879605b256590404